    "https://careers.owu.edu/channels/alumni/": {
      "title": "Alumni & Friends",
      "description": "Alumni & Friends - Career Connection Skip to content No results Alumni Coach Referral Program Career Ambassadors Career Connection Team Channels Alumni & Friends Careers with Social Impact Economics and Business Education Employers Entrepreneurship Exploratory Faculty & Staff Find a Job/Internship/Research Opportunity Graduate School Humanities and The Arts Interviewing Networking OWU Strengths Pre-Health STEM Write a Resume or Cover Letter Fairs and Events Grant Funds Home Page Resources Bishop Launch Program Career Clarity & Strategy Group Career Readiness Course Designing Your Future Course Impact Report Outcomes Data Real Life 101 Workplace Readiness Certificate Student Coaches/Interns Virtual Externships (Forage) ‹ OWU Homepage SUBMIT YOUR INTERNSHIP EXPERIENCE SCHEDULE AN APPOINTMENT IG IN Search Career Communities Careers with Social Impact Economics and Business Education Entrepreneurship Exploratory Humanities and The Arts Pre-Health STEM Programs Bishop Launch Program Real Life 101 Career Clarity & Strategy Group Designing Your Future Course Career Readiness Course Fairs and Events Career Preparation OWU Strengths Workplace Readiness Certificate Alumni Partners Resume & Cover Letters Job, Internship, Research Interviewing Networking Graduate School Virtual Externships (Forage) Grant Funds Our Team Career Connection Team Student Coaches/Interns Career Ambassadors Impact Report Outcomes Data Partnerships Faculty & Staff Employers Alumni & Friends Alumni Coach Referral Program Menu Alumni Alumni Career Connection Programs and Resources Bishops helping Bishops! Being an OWU alum has its advantages! You can make an impact by volunteering your time and sharing your professional experiences with current OWU students and Alumni. Additionally, Career Connection offers lifetime services to help alums reach their professional goals. Explore our vast resources and get connected with other alumni and friends of OWU! Alumni Career Appointment Request Get Career Support + Schedule a 1:1 meeting with an OWU Career Catalyst. Please email careers@owu.edu with questions and to schedule a meeting. Attend an OWU Career Fair or Event as an Alum! Access our career guides and support resources below. Hire a Bishop + We would love to partner with you! Career Connection is seeking to increase Alumni partnerships at places of employment. Please learn more about being an Employer Page . Want to hire a Bishop for a job or an internship? Please email careers@owu.edu with your opportunity, and we will share it in our newsletters and on our UConnect virtual career center! We also encourage you to post on Handshake , as our virtual career center will pull in all postings. Please reach out to Leigh Mascolino , Director of Career Connection to discuss additional partnership opportunities, pipelines, and Career Treks. Become an OWU Alumni Partner + Alumni Partners Program As an Alumni Partner, your contact information is available on our website. Students, alumni, and faculty/staff can reach out for 1:1 conversations, presentation invitations, and other engagements. There is not a guarantee that you will be contacted or engaged during an academic year, but you will be considered first for student connections, presentations, networking events, and other contributions (in person or virtually). Through this program, you will contribute to the success of our students and alumni, and you will remain closely connected with OWU. We hope you’ll consider joining us in this new initiative to strategically connect our students and alumni! Check out our Alumni Partner Initiative page Please contact Leigh Mascolino at lemascolin@owu.edu with questions. Career Resources & Job Boards Student Assistantship Program (StAP) Discover on-campus paid internships. Legacy Internships Discover on-campus paid internships for Legacy Students. First Gen Internship Discover on-campus paid internships for First Gen Students. NACE Competency Self-Assessment Are you career-ready? Discover more through this self-assessment tool. Exploratory Guide Exploratory Guide OWU Career Connection Overview Brochure/ Guide An introduction to OWU’s most important resource- Career Connection! 1 2 3 4 >> LinkedIn Resources OWU Alumni LinkedIn Group to engage with OWU Alumni on LinkedIn. OWU STEM Alumni LinkedIn OWU STEM Alumni LinkedIn PASS: Prevention Awareness Support Services PASS: Prevention Awareness Support Services Meet the Team Leigh Mascolino Director of Career Connection Carolyn Lammert Assistant Director, Career Catalyst Program and Liaison for Economics and Business Newton Kimberly '13 Career Catalyst, Social Impact, Humanities & The Arts Mindy Agin Assistant Director of Career Planning & Exploration Hours Monday - Friday 8:30 am - 5:00 pm Drop-ins Daily : Monday & Wednesday :11:00 am 1:00pm; Tuesday & Thursday: 12-2pm Contact P 740-368-3152 E careers@owu.edu Location Slocum Hall 207 61 S. Sandusky St. Delaware, OH 43015 Ohio Wesleyan University 61 S. Sandusky St. Delaware, OH 43015 | 800-922-8953 | 740-368-3314"
