ally responsible business, to investing in our Associates, we're always looking at how we can make tomorrow brighter.  As an […] Graphic Design Intern – Fall 2026 at OneHope August 28, 2026 Employer: OneHope Expires: 09/12/2026 OneHope is a global ministry that seeks to catalyze a movement to help every child in every generation encounter Jesus through engagement with God's Word. By working with local churches, international ministry partners, schools, and governments, […] Communications Intern – Fall 2026 at OneHope August 27, 2026 Employer: OneHope Expires: 09/12/2026 OneHope is a global ministry that seeks to catalyze a movement to help every child in every generation encounter Jesus through engagement with God's Word. By working with local churches, international ministry partners, schools, and governments, […] Professional Associations National Association of Black Journalists A COMMITMENT TO DIVERSITY\n\n\nAn advocacy group established in 1975 in Washington, D.C., the National Association of Black Journalists (NABJ) is the nation’s largest organization for journalists of color.\n\n\nWe provide our members with career development, educational opportunities, and other support worldwide.\n\n\nMembership is open to anyone wanting to help advance our mission of supporting excellence in journalism and ... National Association of Black Accountants National Association of Black Accountants Meet the Team Leigh Mascolino Director of Career Connection Carolyn Lammert Assistant Director, Career Catalyst Program and Liaison for Economics and Business Newton Kimberly '13 Career Catalyst, Social Impact, Humanities & The Arts Mindy Agin Assistant Director of Career Planning & Exploration Hours Monday - Friday 8:30 am - 5:00 pm Drop-ins Daily : Monday & Wednesday :11:00 am 1:00pm; Tuesday & Thursday: 12-2pm Contact P 740-368-3152 E careers@owu.edu Location Slocum Hall 207 61 S. Sandusky St. Delaware, OH 43015 Ohio Wesleyan University 61 S. Sandusky St. Delaware, OH 43015 | 800