h-School or College), School Administration/Policy, and Research). Careers in Education Higher Education, Student Services, Administration Teacher (Elementary, Middle, High-School) Educational/Instructional Design Consultant Training and Development Counseling/Social Work Education Policy Informal Education/Camping Speech Pathology Special Needs Teacher Volunteering Campus and Community Opportunities + There are great opportunities to develop/improve your teaching skills.  Please check with Mindy to get connected to these experiences. Early Childhood Center Bishop Scholars Big Brothers/Big Sisters Delaware County United Way Grace Clinic Ohio Wildlife Center Seeking Alumni in Education ? Look no further! We have a cultivated list of Alums who are eager to speak with you. Check out their profiles and reach out! Access tools on our Build a Network page for further templates and resources! EDUCATION ALUMNI PARTNERS We strongly encourage that you create a LinkedIn profile ! This is a great way to build your network and connect with fellow Alumni, faculty, and connections from OWU. Check out 15,000+ OWU Alumni , and join the OWU group below! OWU ALUMNI & FRIENDS GROUP Search JOIN THIS CAREER COMMUNITY! SCHEDULE AN APPOINTMENT Meet your Career Catalyst Mindy Agin Assistant Director of Career Planning & Exploration Upcoming Events Alumni Partner Meet & Greet – The Art of the Informational Interview (Thursday, September 10th 2026, 7:00 pm – 8:00 pm EDT) July 8, 2026 Featured Jobs Recreation Leader Trainee (General) (Bilingual) at City of Philadelphia August 19, 2026 Chelsea, Michigan-Great Start Readiness Program (GSRP) Lead Teacher and Assistant Teacher at KinderCare Learning Companies August 13, 2026 Okemos, Michigan-Great Start Readiness Program (GSRP) Lead Teacher and Assistant Teacher at KinderCare Learning Companies August 13, 2026 Featured Internships Outdoor Leadership / Recreation Management Intern at Camp Arrowhead for Boys September 4, 2026 LifeKids Internship at 