by our team with students to help them learn more about themselves, identify strengths, and discover exciting major and career possibilities to explore include: Challenge Cards Design Thinking Wandering Maps OWU Strengths Career Workshops Alumni Panels Match Major Sheets Exploratory Websites Much much more! For more information, contact Mindy Agin ( mbagin@owu.edu ). Seeking Alumni in Education ? Look no further! We have a cultivated list of Alums who are eager to speak with you. Check out their profiles and reach out! Access tools on our Build a Network page for further templates and resources! EDUCATION ALUMNI PARTNERS We strongly encourage that you create a LinkedIn profile ! This is a great way to build your network and connect with fellow Alumni, faculty, and connections from OWU. Check out 15,000+ OWU Alumni , and join the OWU group below! OWU ALUMNI & FRIENDS GROUP Search JOIN THIS CAREER COMMUNITY! SCHEDULE AN APPOINTMENT Meet your Career Catalyst Mindy Agin Assistant Director of Career Planning & Exploration Upcoming Events Alumni Partner Meet & Greet – The Art of the Informational Interview (Thursday, September 10th 2026, 7:00 pm – 8:00 pm EDT) July 8, 2026 Featured Jobs Sexual Assault Response Coordinator (SARC) at Naval Civilian Careers August 28, 2026 Tax Technician 1 or Tax Technician Trainee 1 at NYS Department of Taxation and Finance August 26, 2026 Auditor Trainee (TAX) or Auditor 1 (TAX) (CID) – Schenectady County (ID222263) (Full Time – On Site Position in Schenectady, NY) at NYS Department of Taxation and Finance August 26, 2026 Featured Internships Summer 2027 Mars Snacking Operations Internship at Mars, Inc. September 3, 2026 Marketing internship at T-Swirl Crepe August 31, 2026 Summer Associate,  Client Service, New York, 2027 at AlphaSights August 31, 2026 Templates & Examples Education Resume Sample An example of a Education Resume – download and review. OWU Alumni Partners Mindy Agin Assistant Director of Career Planning & Exploration Steph