 […] Featured Internships Summer 2027 Mars Snacking Operations Internship at Mars, Inc. September 3, 2026 Employer: Mars, Inc. Expires: 09/12/2026 At Mars, we work together to build a better world for people, pets, and the planet. From being a socially responsible business, to investing in our Associates, we're always looking at how we can make tomorrow brighter.  As an […] Marketing internship at T-Swirl Crepe August 31, 2026 Employer: T-Swirl Crepe Expires: 09/13/2026 1.  Influencer Marketing ​- Research and reach out to influencers, coordinate store visits and collaborations, follow up on deliverables, and track results.2. Brand Partnerships ​- Research potential brands and local businesses for collaborations, cross-promotions, and […] Summer Associate,  Client Service, New York, 2027 at AlphaSights August 31, 2026 Employer: AlphaSights Expires: 09/16/2026 Start date: June 7, 2027End date: August 13, 2027Duration: 10 weeksLooking for an internship with commercial frontline responsibility and the opportunity to work on live client projects? Do you seek to have immediate personal impact? If […] Gain Experience Greif Internships & Early Career Development 📍Delaware, OH, United States\n\n\n\nSponsor: Greif\n\n\n\n\nApply by: Oct 1, 2026\n\n\n\nAt Greif, we understand the value of cultivating a pipeline of talented individuals at the beginning of their professional journey. As such, Greif facilitates a number of Early Career programs to encourage growth & development through our Internship & Co-Op opportunities. Our Early Career Program in the ... Summer on the Cuyahoga (SOTC) 📍OH, United States\n\n\n\nSponsor: Summer on the Cuyahoga \n\n\n\n\nApply by: Nov 1, 2026\n\n\n\nUnforgettable Summer Internship Experiences are Made in Cleveland!\n\n\nSummer on the Cuyahoga (SOTC) connects young talent with professional opportunities in Northeast Ohio. The program immerses 70-80 students in the Cleveland area, in challenging internships with over 40 employers in a wide variety ... Ohio Department of Natural Resources Summer Internships 📍OH, United States\n\n\n\nSponsor: Ohio Department of Natural Resources\n\n\n\n\nApply by: Nov 1, 2026\n\n\n\nODNR offers hands-on, mission-driven summer internships across Ohio, giving students the chance to explore careers in conservation, science, education, law enforcement, communications, and more. Interns play a direct role in protecting Ohio’s natural resources — including forests, rivers, wildlife, and geological features — while ... Meet the Team Leigh Mascolino Director of Career Connection Carolyn Lammert Assistant Director, Career Catalyst Program and Liaison for Economics and Business Newton Kimberly '13 Career Catalyst, Social Impact, Humanities & The Arts Mindy Agin Assistant Director of Career Planning & Exploration Hours Monday - Friday 8:30 am - 5:00 pm Drop-ins Daily : Monday & Wednesday :11:00 am 1:00pm; Tuesday & Thursday: 12-2pm Contact P 740-368-3152 E careers@owu.edu Location Slocum Hall 207 61 S. Sandusky St. Delaware, OH 43015 Ohio Wesleyan University 61 S. Sandusky St. Delaware, OH 43015 | 800-922-8953 | 740-368-3314"
