      "title": "Write a Resume or Cover Letter",
      "description": "Write a Resume or Cover Letter - Career Connection Skip to content No results Alumni Coach Referral Program Career Ambassadors Career Connection Team Channels Alumni & Friends Careers with Social Impact Economics and Business Education Employers Entrepreneurship Exploratory Faculty & Staff Find a Job/Internship/Research Opportunity Graduate School Humanities and The Arts Interviewing Networking OWU Strengths Pre-Health STEM Write a Resume or Cover Letter Fairs and Events Grant Funds Home Page Resources Bishop Launch Program Career Clarity & Strategy Group Career Readiness Course Designing Your Future Course Impact Report Outcomes Data Real Life 101 Workplace Readiness Certificate Student Coaches/Interns Virtual Externships (Forage) ‹ OWU Homepage SUBMIT YOUR INTERNSHIP EXPERIENCE SCHEDULE AN APPOINTMENT IG IN Search Career Communities Careers with Social Impact Economics and Business Education Entrepreneurship Exploratory Humanities and The Arts Pre-Health STEM Programs Bishop Launch Program Real Life 101 Career Clarity & Strategy Group Designing Your Future Course Career Readiness Course Fairs and Events Career Preparation OWU Strengths Workplace Readiness Certificate Alumni Partners Resume & Cover Letters Job, Internship, Research Interviewing Networking Graduate School Virtual Externships (Forage) Grant Funds Our Team Career Connection Team Student Coaches/Interns Career Ambassadors Impact Report Outcomes Data Partnerships Faculty & Staff Employers Alumni & Friends Alumni Coach Referral Program Menu Write a Resume or Cover Letter Writing a Resume or Cover Letter The resume is an important marketing tool that provides a summary of your education, skills, experience, achievements, and leadership. A well-written resume should highlight experiences that are relevant to the job, internship, or program for which you are applying and should be tailored to the job description. The primary purpose of a resume is to get an interview. The goal is to move the employer to contact you. Below you will find resume templates to get you started as well as additional resume support resources. Templates & Examples STEM & Pre-Health CV TEMPLATE Check out this template and make a “copy” to customize it. Research Emphasis CV EXAMPLE II (STEM & Pre-Health) An example of a Research CV – download and review. Research Based CV (STEM & Pre-Health) EXAMPLE An example of a Research CV – download and review. Humanities & The Arts Resume Example (Theatre) An example of a Theatre Resume – download and review. History Resume Example History major looking to market your skills on your resume for an upcoming opportunity? Check out this example! Education Resume Sample An example of a Education Resume – download and review. 1 2 3 >> Meet the Team Leigh Mascolino Director of Career Connection Carolyn Lammert Assistant Director, Career Catalyst Program and Liaison for Economics and Business Newton Kimberly '13 Career Catalyst, Social Impact, Humanities & The Arts Mindy Agin Assistant Director of Career Planning & Exploration Hours Monday - Friday 8:30 am - 5:00 pm Drop-ins Daily : Monday & Wednesday :11:00 am 1:00pm; Tuesday & Thursday: 12-2pm Contact P 740-368-3152 E careers@owu.edu Location Slocum Hall 207 61 S. Sandusky St. Delaware, OH 43015 Ohio Wesleyan University 61 S. Sandusky St. Delaware, OH 43015 | 800-922-8953 | 740-368-3314"
