TUTIONS TOP EMPLOYERS Source: Ohio Wesleyan University Outcomes Data Reports Please see our 2024 data here and past data snapshots below! Meet the Team Leigh Mascolino Director of Career Connection Carolyn Lammert Assistant Director, Career Catalyst Program and Liaison for Economics and Business Newton Kimberly '13 Career Catalyst, Social Impact, Humanities & The Arts Mindy Agin Assistant Director of Career Planning & Exploration Hours Monday - Friday 8:30 am - 5:00 pm Drop-ins Daily : Monday & Wednesday :11:00 am 1:00pm; Tuesday & Thursday: 12-2pm Contact P 740-368-3152 E careers@owu.edu Location Slocum Hall 207 61 S. Sandusky St. Delaware, OH 43015 Ohio Wesleyan University 61 S. Sandusky St. Delaware, OH 43015 | 800-922-8953 | 740-368-3314"
